<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Chancellor Broadcasting.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Chancellor Broadcasting.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Alex. Brown said it initiated coverage of Chancellor Broadcasting Co as a strong buy.</p>
<p>-- Additional details were not immediately available.</p>
<p>-- On Tuesday, Evergreen Media Corp said it would buy Chancellor Broadcasting in a stock swap. The new company would then acquire 10 radio properties owned by Viacom Inc, creating a company worth about $5 billion.</p>
</text>
